The snippet assumes you already have:

| Variable | Type | What it represents |
|----------|------|---------------------|
| `task` | `Task` | The task that triggered the request (can be `null` if you don’t care). |
| `usageRequest` | `XPackUsageRequest` | The request object you want to send. |
| `clusterState` | `ClusterState` | The current state of the cluster. |
| `actionListener` | `ActionListener<ClusterUsageResponse>` | Listener that will receive the usage statistics. |

